# Hintforge corpus .gitignore -- DENY-BY-DEFAULT.
# Generated by corpus-deploy from the resolved manifest's `vector-extensions:`.
# Nothing ships unless whitelisted below. User state/setup and dev scaffolding
# are excluded by NOT being listed -- the skill never has to predict them.
*
!.gitignore
!*/

# --- Fixed spine (universal core per docs/corpus-format.md) ---
# NOTE: CHECKPOINT.md is universal core too, but is DELIBERATELY excluded here --
# it is per-user playthrough state (player name, save slots, dials). Do not add it.
!nav/**
!architecture_manifest.md
!items/**
!sections/**
!_overflow/**
!achievements.md
!controls.md
!dependencies.md
!limitations.md
!mechanics.md
!persona.md
!settings.md
!warning_tiers.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!DISCLAIMER.md

# --- Release presentation (README + status card from step 4d) ---
!README.md
!assets/**

# --- Save reader: reusable TOOLS only ---
# The extractor's outputs (save_state/latest.json, save_state/roster_extract.json)
# are the player's own state and never ship; only the compound id map does.
!save_watcher.py
!save_extract.py
!save_schema.md
!save_state/compound_id_map.json
!ui_reference.md

# --- Interactive artifacts: reusable TOOLS only ---
# Agents are randomly generated per playthrough, so no filled dossier card ships;
# only the blank template a player fills from their own save.
!artifacts/card_template/agent_dossier_template.html

# --- Declared vector-extensions (one !<ext>/** per manifest entry) ---
!npcs/**
!factions/**
!paths/**
